      "artist": "Rudi Winter",
      "description": "St Dogmael's tour guide. Despite the name of the abbey, St Dogmaels, they've employed a cat as official tour guide.  After having returned some other visitors to the exit, the guide sat posing on this wall until I'd taken its picture and then showed us round the whole abbey, pointing out places of particular interest such as the medieval water supplies (661265), ovens (661273) and the church itself (309699).  Then it led us back to the entrance and went back - no doubt ready for the next customers!",
      "dateCreated": "2007-07-15",
